<title>SINGAPORE: STIC 1H net profit up 20.9 pct.</title>
<headline>STIC 1H net profit up 20.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		     30.69   vs    25.40</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)	  4.50   vs     3.72</p>
<p>    Turnover			766.93   vs   622.75</p>
<p>    Investment income	     1.98   vs     0.54</p>
<p>    Interest income		 7.17   vs     7.49</p>
<p>    Interest expense	     18.28   vs    14.70</p>
<p>    Pretax profit		   61.84  vs    51.28</p>
<p>    Tax				 18.99  vs    15.58</p>
<p>    Minorities (loss)	     12.16  vs    10.30</p>
<p>Note --Singapore Technologies Industrial Corp is a diversified industrial conglomerate.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
